        {
          "text": "Ala umuúqo heewo oo dabér Munguúwók ga iialoeemisaaká nee ar waawutmoowo, ku sakwasleemuuti ar gaanslaay, laqaá ar kuwa gaasi, laqaá kuwa lohaatisi, laqaá daqaari'iimarós kawa hayoohi, laqaá kuwa tseegi.»",
